Channel eldritch forces into a ferocious melee attack, hitting the target three times with your shields doing [104%, 123%, 137%, 149%, 160% (TL1-5)] Nature damage.

If any of the attacks hit, the target will be dazed for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns and your Block cooldown is reset.

The chance for the attack to daze increases with you Physical Power, but it is considered a magical attack and thus is resisted with spell save, rather than physical save.
